{"id":"n73228-1-7","stage":1,"title":"화가 · 画家","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73228-1-7-1","ko":"이 그림에는 시가 함께 적혀 있군요.","zh":"这幅画上还写着诗呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"그림에는","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림에는","audio":"/audio/009ea5fd8a0f4384bcbd.mp3"}},{"text":"시가","meaning":"诗","explanation":"시：诗；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15954","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시가","audio":"/audio/5679b0c2fa66bbad0652.mp3"}},{"text":"함께","meaning":"也、一并","explanation":"함께 表示诗和画同时出现在这幅画上，这里可译为“也”。","readings":[{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72465","senseId":"2","lemma":"함께","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}},{"text":"적혀","meaning":"被写下","explanation":"적히다：被写下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"적히다","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25069","senseId":"1","lemma":"적히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적혀","audio":"/audio/53c0b094de0f08fa40a7.mp3"}},{"text":"있군요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있군요","audio":"/audio/3efb6baa8f951fba5d0a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"诗","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"15954","definition":"通过有韵律的形式来表达作者的想法和感受的文学作品。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"6d2b6bbf82785e6d","term":"함께","zh":"一并、同时","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3","entryId":"72465","definition":"与别的事物一同出现；本句指画上也写着诗。","pronunciation":["함께"]},{"id":"7998eec620b7e3cc","term":"적히다","zh":"被写下","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3","entryId":"25069","definition":"被用文字记下来。","pronunciation":["저키다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a46e6d8259163b7ec3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73228-1-7-2","ko":"화가가 시를 짓기도 하거든요.","zh":"画家也会创作诗歌的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화가가","meaning":"画家","explanation":"화가：画家；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73228","senseId":"1","lemma":"화가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화가가","audio":"/audio/8f1dab046fb2fe205bf3.mp3"}},{"text":"시를","meaning":"诗","explanation":"시：诗；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15954","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시를","audio":"/audio/8a99fb164f9e50da0cfd.mp3"}},{"text":"짓기도","meaning":"作","explanation":"짓다：作；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"짓다","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66585","senseId":"3","lemma":"짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짓기도","audio":"/audio/6293b57ecd44c39b9748.mp3"}},{"text":"하거든요.","meaning":"也会","explanation":"-기도 하다 表示“也做”；-거든요 补充说明理由：画家也会作诗。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하거든요","audio":"/audio/5c51afcafe66e6a43144.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b04487b70213c84b","term":"화가","zh":"画家","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3","entryId":"73228","definition":"专业画画的人。","pronunciation":["화ː가"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"诗","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"15954","definition":"通过有韵律的形式来表达作者的想法和感受的文学作品。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"e17bf0fed41df779","term":"짓다","zh":"作","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3","entryId":"66585","definition":"写诗歌、小说、信、歌词等。","pronunciation":["짇ː따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"也会（-기도 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"与 -기도 连用表示某事也会发生；本句说明画家也会写诗。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e51d3a6eaa5c152777b5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.038,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73228","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5515,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这幅画上还写着诗呢。","画家也会创作诗歌的。","你听清楚智秀说的话了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这幅画上还写着诗呢。","画家也会创作诗歌的。","你听清楚智秀说的话了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
